^nDate Formatting Options^n
The date formats allow the displayed date to have the following formats:^n
 For example: The dates 31 Dec 1998 and 01 Jan 2000.^n
 0 - standard format,  99Dec31, and 100Jan01.^n
 1 - long format, 1999Dec31, and 2000Jan01.^n
 2 - short format, 99Dec31, and 00Jan01.^n

Note:  You may enter dates in any of these formats for any READ commands^n^n
Enter Format Option:^s